nsight-aftermath provides an imported SHARED target:

    find_package(unofficial-nsight-aftermath CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::nsight-aftermath::nsight-aftermath)

The SDK itself is not redistributed by this port. Set the NSIGHT_AFTERMATH_SDK
environment variable to the extracted SDK root (the directory containing
'include' and 'lib') before running vcpkg.
